==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|barbarus||foreigner, savage|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|βάρβαρος||foreign, strange|lang=grc}}.

===Alternative forms===
* {{gloss|obsolete}} [[barbarouse]]

===Pronunciation===
